  "claim": "Catherine Louise Sagal (born January 19, 1954) is an American actress and singer-songwriter, she's know as well for starring in the role of Cate Hennessy, on the show \"8 Simple Rules\", is an American sitcom, originally starring Kurt Sutter as the father.",
