        "original_id": "bf95dbe2-4067-5782-8936-c1af60e8b54c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katey Sagal, John Ritter\n- TV Shows: Married... with Children, Futurama, 8 Simple Rules\n- Characters: Peggy Bundy, Leela, Cate Hennessy, Paul Hennessy\n\nFacts:\n- Katey Sagal is best known for playing Peggy Bundy, Al Bundy's sarcastic, lazy, bon bon-eating wife, on Married... with Children.\n- From 1999 to 2003 and from 2008 to 2013, Katey Sagal voiced Leela on the animated science-fiction series Futurama.\n- In the first season, 8 Simple Rules was originally titled 8 Simple Rules for Dating My Teenage Daughter.\n- 8 Simple Rules is an American sitcom about middle-class parents raising a family of three.\n- 8 Simple Rules originally starred John Ritter as Paul Hennessy and Katey Sagal as Cate Hennessy.\n- Katey Sagal is also known for starring on 8 Simple Rules as Cate Hennessy.",
